target:    .github/workflows/ci.yml
gate:      composer test:ci-comment-metrics
kind:      introduce-defect
expect:    a count spelled as a WORD beside `entries`
rationale: States a registry count in words instead of digits. This is the exact form the block carried until 2026-09-04 -- `SEVEN entries gate on the two seal suites` -- reached through the paragraph beside it, which says historical figures are described rather than quoted so the gate will not read them. That exemption is for prose about the past; used for a current figure it is a hole, and four numbers went stale through it.
---
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -193,3 +193,3 @@
         # an instance of it. Per-suite seconds have not been measured since the counts were fixed,
-        # so no figure is given. Run the step and read it.
+        # so no figure is given. Run the step and read it. Twelve entries are slow.
         #
